<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Alonso's willingness to learn and adapt his approach based on the needs of his team and the challenges they face is a hallmark of his leadership. He is not rigid in his tactics or philosophy; instead, he is open to feedback and willing to make adjustments to ensure the team's success. This flexibility has been crucial in responding to the dynamic nature of football competitions.Through an examination of his influences, adaptations, and innovations, we uncover the essence of what makes Alonso's Leverkusen a formidable force in modern football. )
/E (Alonso's willingness to learn and adapt his approach based on the needs of his team and the challenges they face is a hallmark of his leadership. He is not rigid in his tactics or philosophy; instead, he is open to feedback and willing to make adjustments to ensure the team's success. This flexibility has been crucial in responding to the dynamic nature of football competitions.Through an examination of his influences, adaptations, and innovations, we uncover the essence of what makes Alonso's Leverkusen a formidable force in modern football. )
