672 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (When facing a mid-defensive block, Xabi Alonso transitions from asymetrical low build-up 4-2-3-1 formation and implements a more attacking 3-2-2-3 or 3-2-4-1 structure to create numerical superiority in key areas and maintain control over transitions. The formation balances defensive stability with an offensive setup designed to break down the opposition's lines, particularly by using positional overloads and precise passing patterns. The 3-2 base provides defensive security, ensuring that the team is well-prepared for transitions, especially against counter-attacks. The 2-3 shape ahead of them, featuring striker and two wing-backs, creates a platform to overload central areas, with the wing-backs staying wide to stretch the defense horizontally. This forces the opposition to remain uncertain about whether Leverkusen will progress through the center or exploit wide spaces.)
/E (When facing a mid-defensive block, Xabi Alonso transitions from asymetrical low build-up 4-2-3-1 formation and implements a more attacking 3-2-2-3 or 3-2-4-1 structure to create numerical superiority in key areas and maintain control over transitions. The formation balances defensive stability with an offensive setup designed to break down the opposition's lines, particularly by using positional overloads and precise passing patterns. The 3-2 base provides defensive security, ensuring that the team is well-prepared for transitions, especially against counter-attacks. The 2-3 shape ahead of them, featuring striker and two wing-backs, creates a platform to overload central areas, with the wing-backs staying wide to stretch the defense horizontally. This forces the opposition to remain uncertain about whether Leverkusen will progress through the center or exploit wide spaces.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
