/E (Central progressions as the focus: While Leverkusen can stretch the field with their wing-backs, Alonso prioritizes central progressions. Playing through the center is often the most direct way to create high-quality chances. The principle of "playing inside before outside" means that the team looks to break through central channels first.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
