/E (If the press is not triggered: When the opposition decides not to press aggressively, Leverkusen's playmakers have time and space to orchestrate attacks from deeper positions. Florian Wirtz, in particular, becomes dangerous in these situations. If he drops into space without pressure, he can find time on the ball to pick out incisive passes that break through the defensive lines, creating goal-scoring opportunities.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
