/T (Pattern A: 1. CB plays a pass to DM. 2. DM plays it back to a second CB. 3. CB plays it up to AMC. 4. AMC plays it back to DM. 5. DM plays it LWB making a run into space. Defending team presses passively until the ball is played wide to the wing-back, from then an unrestricted situation \(with wing back aiming to score and defending team trying to prevent it\).)
/E (Pattern A: 1. CB plays a pass to DM. 2. DM plays it back to a second CB. 3. CB plays it up to AMC. 4. AMC plays it back to DM. 5. DM plays it LWB making a run into space. Defending team presses passively until the ball is played wide to the wing-back, from then an unrestricted situation \(with wing back aiming to score and defending team trying to prevent it\).)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
