/S /H5
/T (Pattern B: 1. CB plays a pass to AMC. 2. AMC plays it to DM 3. DM plays it up to ST. 4. ST lays it off to AMC moving towards him. 5. AMC plays it wide to the RWB making a run into space. Defending team presses passively until the ball is played wide to the wing-back, from then an unrestricted situation \(with wing back aiming to score and defending team trying to prevent it\).)
/E (Pattern B: 1. CB plays a pass to AMC. 2. AMC plays it to DM 3. DM plays it up to ST. 4. ST lays it off to AMC moving towards him. 5. AMC plays it wide to the RWB making a run into space. Defending team presses passively until the ball is played wide to the wing-back, from then an unrestricted situation \(with wing back aiming to score and defending team trying to prevent it\).)
